OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers along the west coast
OL,7,Fovernight, otherwise mainly dry.
OL,8,FFreshening southerly winds will bring
OL,9,Foccasional rain to the Western Isles
OL,10,Fand Skye later. Chilly in the east.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA cloudy day with outbreaks
OL,13,Fof rain spreading east through the
OL,14,Fmorning followed by a few showers in
OL,15,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
