OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry and bright on Friday but a few
OL,7,Fshowers across the west. Rain will
OL,8,Fspread east for a time on Saturday.
OL,9,FDrier and brighter with a few showers
OL,10,FSunday.
